### User Settings API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### Variables - Update with actual user ID
@userId = 

###
### Get User Settings (replace {userId} with actual UUID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user-settings/{{userId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### Update User Settings - Notification Preferences (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user-settings/{{userId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "preference_type": "notifications",
  "options": {
    "email_enabled": true,
    "push_enabled": false,
    "task_reminders": true,
    "points_updates": true
  }
}

###
### Update User Settings - Theme Preferences (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user-settings/{{userId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "preference_type": "theme",
  "options": {
    "mode": "dark",
    "color_scheme": "blue"
  }
}

###
### Update User Settings - Language Preferences (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/user-settings/{{userId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "preference_type": "language",
  "options": {
    "locale": "pl",
    "timezone": "Europe/Warsaw"
  }
}

###
### Update User Settings - Privacy Preferences (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/user-settings/{{userId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "preference_type": "privacy",
  "options": {
    "profile_visible": true,
    "show_points": false
  }
}

###
### Update User Settings - Missing Fields (should return 400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user-settings/{{userId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "preference_type": "notifications"
}

###
### Update User Settings - Invalid Format (should return 400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user-settings/{{userId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "invalid_field": "value"
}
